id: hac-1iz2
title: Add token-efficient entity deltas and automation platform discovery
description: "Expose current Home Assistant subscribe_entities and trigger/condition platform subscription contracts as typed bounded agent-native CLI workflows, with live 2026.7 validation and release-safe PM evidence."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 0
tags[5]: agents,automation,home-assistant,streaming,websocket
created_at: "2026-07-31T20:21:27.042Z"
