comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:27.042Z",codex-root,"Selected after duplicate search across all 63 statuses; this extends, rather than duplicates, bounded trigger subscriptions by modeling entity-delta and platform-subscription protocols."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:27.042Z",codex-root,Official documentation and tagged Home Assistant Core 2026.7.4 are primary contract sources. Live output is used only for redacted schema-level validation.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:27.042Z",codex-root,"The public WebSocket guide documents stable commands, while tagged Core source is required to discover current optimized subscription contracts such as subscribe_entities and platform subscriptions."
