body: "Research current official Home Assistant 2026.7 documentation and tagged Core source; implement typed bounded subscriptions with deterministic filtering and normalized envelopes; cover transport, command, help, format, docs, live read-only, package, and release behavior; preserve raw WebSocket passthrough for forward compatibility."
